abstract: >
  Analysis code used to replicate the analyses and figures reported in
  "Frequency magnification in human primary auditory cortex nearly predicts
  behavioural frequency hyperacuity", an ultra-high-field (7 Tesla)
  functional MRI study investigating the cortical representation of sound
  frequency in human primary auditory cortex and its relationship to
  cochlear selectivity, cortical frequency magnification, and frequency
  discrimination performance.

